      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{61f890b930eb245a06544020|full_name} I know that workaround as you can notice from read. Isn't it stupid to keep updating the project this way? Manual installation is a source of project-collapsion. \n\nHowever, it has worth to be documented somewhere not here. I think ask.vrchat.com is good for that.",
